{"unit_id":"Thunderunruly__workspace-settings#card-zh","repo":"Thunderunruly/workspace-settings","commit":"9a30b45228340a1d0d8d7b5dcb7dd0eb3575bb98","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Workspace Settings 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，为每个工作区保存会话默认值。它在设置页和工作区菜单中提供编辑入口，可配置 Agent 模式、权限预设、模型与推理强度，以及 Chat 工作步骤展示级别和收起时机。创建或复用空白普通会话时，宿主端按工作区应用模式、权限和首个模型请求；会话内明确选择的值仍优先。Chat 展示偏好随当前工作区切换，并在离开后恢复基线。数据保存在本地 JSON 文件，不需要额外账号或 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1661-1678","index.js:670-718","index.js:726-745","client.js:1487-1491"]}
{"unit_id":"Thunderunruly__workspace-settings#card-en","repo":"Thunderunruly/workspace-settings","commit":"9a30b45228340a1d0d8d7b5dcb7dd0eb3575bb98","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Workspace Settings saves agent mode, permissions and model per workspace. Its Web UI adds a settings page and workspace menu. Blank sessions inherit these defaults; the model applies to the first request. Chat details follow the active workspace. Data stays local; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1661-1678","index.js:670-718","index.js:726-745","client.js:1487-1491"]}
