{"unit_id":"Thunderunruly__workspace-settings#feature-1","repo":"Thunderunruly/workspace-settings","commit":"9a30b45228340a1d0d8d7b5dcb7dd0eb3575bb98","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Workspace Settings 的功能「工作区默认值」：为单个工作区选择 Agent 模式、权限预设、模型和推理强度。修改任一选择后立即保存到该工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:860-924"]}
